{
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "butcher_new_greeting_smoke",
      "request": "greeting",
      "weight": 26,
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "line_0",
          "text": "If you smell <wavy>smoke</wavy>, that is supper being planned properly."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_1",
          "text": "Give the smokehouse room. Butchery works better without elbows in it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_2",
          "text": "Step carefully near the smokehouse. I would rather greet you than patch you up."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_3",
          "text": "There you are. I was just near the smoker, trying to keep the day sensible."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_4",
          "text": "Come in, but mind the hooks and the smoke."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_5",
          "text": "Morning. If you are hungry, you picked a dangerous place to stand."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_6",
          "text": "I have clean hands, sharp tools, and a little time."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_7",
          "text": "Step around the table. It has work on it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_8",
          "text": "Hello. The smokehouse is behaving, so I can talk."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_9",
          "text": "You caught me before the next batch needs turning."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_10",
          "text": "If you need something wrapped, wait until I finish this thought."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_11",
          "text": "Careful where you lean. Everything has a purpose here."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_12",
          "text": "Good to see you without a complaint about stew."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_13",
          "text": "I can spare a moment while the smoke does its part."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_14",
          "text": "Speak up. The cleaver is louder than manners today."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_15",
          "text": "Welcome, if you washed your hands or at least your intentions."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_16",
          "text": "I was counting stores. Try not to make me start again."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_17",
          "text": "The day smells busy. What do you need?"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_18",
          "text": "Stand clear of the block and tell me your business."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_19",
          "text": "You caught me between the smokehouse and the chopping block."
        },
